WEBVTT

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:13.560
The SNS Club has been in full swing since summer break started.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.640
Some days we work at someone's house, and others we gather at the club room.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.300
Sometimes our opinions clash.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:26.040
Ha-chan still doesn't know that Iris-sensei is Seki-senpai.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:30.260
And Fujikawa-senpai often enters her own world.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:34.780
Through all of that, thanks to the president's schedule management,

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.680
our work has somehow been progressing,

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:53.980
and we've finally finished our new game, Stardust Intenzione.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.960
Back to the Start Line

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.900
Papa, I love you.

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:20.400
Hey! What are you doing sleeping so peacefully?

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.080
Today is summer Comiket.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.180
Ah, Ha-chan...

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:28.380
We're supposed to help out at Temawari's circle at noon, remember?

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:29.460
Hurry up!

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:35.000
Oh? You just got here and you're leaving already?

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:37.100
Yes, sorry for intruding.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.290
I'm leaving!

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:39.840
Take care.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:46.940
If she's in such a hurry, she must have club activities today too, huh?

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:50.300
Whatever it is, what matters is that she's having fun.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:51.810
That's right.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:56.640
This morning's Tamaki. I have to send it to Dad.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:08.370
Feels good! I always wanted to go to the venue by sea at least once.

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:12.610
What are you using that for?

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:16.130
I can't stand crowds, so I came fully equipped.

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:21.250
What does it say?

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:26.360
It's from Ha-chan-san. It seems she caught Honda-san and they're coming.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:29.740
All right! We're all gathering together this time.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:34.730
So, why are you so worn out, Fujikawa-san?

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:37.920
A friend suddenly said they'd be making a CD...

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:41.780
Until just now, I was helping out, burning discs, mixing, and mastering...

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:47.810
You were working on another project after ours?

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.690
Our senpai are already headed for the venue.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:56.730
But you wouldn't answer your phone, so I had to come pick you up.

00:02:57.330 --> 00:03:00.760
Sorry. I forgot to set my alarm clock.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:05.980
It was a lot of trouble. We had to ask our grandmother to let us use the car.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:09.410
Thanks. You had to hurry over, too.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:14.080
Not at all. I wanted to go to a doujin event at least once.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:18.720
I want to see what this thing Minaha is so invested in is.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.520
Eh? You're coming with us to the venue?

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:25.820
We're taking the highway. I dare say we will go faster than the train.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.910
We're getting out here?

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:02.640
Yes. There are no parking areas in front of the venue.

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.660
Thank you very much! See you later!

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.560
Take care!

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:14.520
Are all these people coming to summer Comiket?

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:18.110
This isn't all, there'll be more people inside.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:23.550
That's right, Murakami-senpai said to take care not to get lost.

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:27.070
Well, I guess it's fine to let you hold my hand.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:31.220
Ah!

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:36.170
Why do I have to see Ha-san's face on the day of Comiket of all times?

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.400
Right back at you, why are you here?

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:42.090
Come to think of it, these two don't get along well.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:47.050
We're working as salesgirls today, right?

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:52.140
That's right. I think it'll be educational to work with someone else's circle.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:55.530
Make sure to get stimulated as an artist, too!

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:59.410
I got enough stimulation at the previous event...

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.610
There really are a lot of people.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:05.250
It's a lineup of fierce Comiket soldiers.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:08.620
It looks easy to get lost...

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:12.680
I imagine you'll go around and look at other booths too,

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:16.470
but don't forget that we're entrants, not customers.

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:17.000
Huh?

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:21.200
It's not like we're professional authors, after all.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:25.970
It's important to aim to enjoy this festival together.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:32.470
Speaking of which, boys' love is all you talk about in the Illustration Club. I wonder how that'll go...

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:39.080
This manga's main character and his friend, they've totally crossed the line.

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:45.190
Even if people have a different way of thinking, you have to respect them!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.700
So this is a doujin event.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:59.630
There are more people than I expected.

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:06.900
It is an event where people buy and sell self-published manga, novels, and the like.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:12.620
But is it really something worth devoting countless weeks of one's youth like Minaha does?

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:15.020
It is, Onee-san.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.050
Aah!

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:18.900
I can be your guide if you'd like.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.460
Who might you be?

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:24.670
Where are the senpai?

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:27.360
Don't get lost, Honda Tamaki.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.860
Let's start with this part.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:35.180
Hey! This is the BL section!

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:36.640
And the hard stuff to boot!

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:38.960
We still have time, so it's fine.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:43.580
Look at that innocent reaction! Have you no conscience?

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:47.080
I'll be happy if Tama-chan discovers BL too.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.380
Heretic!

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:53.140
But they're all so good at drawing. Perhaps I should use these as reference too.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.820
Although I'm not sure where to look.

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:57.550
Tama-chan!

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.140
Coming!

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:07.900
Can I read it?

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:09.300
Ah, yes!

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:11.110
Then, if you'll excuse me...

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:13.640
A-a highschooler, I wonder?

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:17.080
Today's new book may be a bit racy...

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.280
Did it catch your attention, Tama-chan?

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:22.810
Um, the man in the cover looked cool...

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:28.230
It's okay to say that to the circle's workers.

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:29.050
I see.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.200
Can I buy one?

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.260
Yes!

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:34.480
That'll be 2,500 yen.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.900
I'm always cheering for you! I brought you these provisions.

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.060
Oh, thank you very much!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:43.160
That person earlier looked so happy.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:47.190
Perhaps I made that face at the previous event too.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.020
Honda-chan!

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:47.670
Huh?

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:48.730
Honda-chan!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.360
It's Fujikawa-senpai's voice.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:53.180
Over here! Hurry!

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.560
What's with that queue!

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:55.960
Ah, you're here, Honda-san!

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:59.000
We're short on hands, hurry up!

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:01.460
We even have rabbit ears, so please!

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:05.060
Did you bring these for me to use?

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:07.310
Huh? Where's Murakami-senpai?

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:08.290
I'm here.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.920
Take that off already!

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:13.530
Not until I get used to this place.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.980
It's our game.

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:29.300
You can get lost in thought later.

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:32.930
This is the new record, and that is a bonus CD we're giving away.

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:35.890
And this is a consignment sale from a different circle.

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:36.530
Got it?

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:39.570
Yes!

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.460
Come on, let's work!

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:43.750
All right!

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.760
Three copies of the new record, please.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:52.880
Y-yes.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:56.490
That's 2,100 yen. And this as a giveaway.

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:59.580
The latest record and the one that came out before.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.130
The latest one and the previous one, is it?

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:03.720
Erm, which one was it...

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.550
Eh?

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:07.550
It's busy enough to make you dizzy.

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:10.250
It's still easier than being a salesgirl.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.760
Ah, but sales work on a shift system here.

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:16.190
You'll have to do it later too.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.300
The new record and also this and this.

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.530
Two copies each of every CD.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.130
Excuse me!

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:43.180
Yes.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.640
Is Temawari-san here today?

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:48.420
I'm a huge fan, and I brought these provisions.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.190
Thank you very much!

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:53.510
So there are places that sell this much too.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.370
It finally slowed down a bit.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.960
Tama-chan, is now a good time?

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:15.140
Ah, yes. We're taking a break now.

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:17.140
Eh? Marika-san?

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:21.640
I wanted to come to this "summer Comiket" event some time.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.180
I also wanted to see you, Honda-san.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.620
I was surprised, too.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:29.560
Honda-san, I bought this.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.520
Ah! Thanks!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:35.420
I also bought a lot of cute figures!

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:38.020
I think I can get into this event.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:40.490
So many...

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.860
Did you buy this circle's new record too, Yumine?

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:45.760
Yes, and I got an autograph too.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:46.620
Isn't that nice?

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:50.180
How many copies of our game did we sell?

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:52.080
It seems it's selling pretty well.

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:54.040
It may be a new record.

00:10:54.590 --> 00:11:00.180
Someday I'd like us to make something that'll create a queue like this on our own merits.

00:11:01.230 --> 00:11:03.030
On our own merits...

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:06.660
Aah!

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:08.710
What are you spacing out for?

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:12.160
We're both doing the art, so what's with that attitude?

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:14.760
Sorry, I was just thinking.

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:15.700
Excuse me...

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:16.730
Yes.

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.600
You're from the June event...

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:29.060
Ah, you remember!

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:33.540
I read on your website that you were selling by consignment here,

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:34.750
so I came.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.680
So, did you purchase our new work?

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:40.180
I haven't yet.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:43.220
You can play the demo here, so go ahead.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:49.560
The drawings are wonderful this time too.

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:50.900
Thank you very much.

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:53.670
Did you draw them all yourself again?

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:56.010
No, I drew them with Ha-chan.

00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:58.990
Ha-chan decided where we should put each picture,

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:03.570
what type of game it should be, and even the music.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:07.450
That's amazing! So you were the leader?

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:12.430
N-no, I'm not something as grandiose as a leader.

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:16.780
But it was you who suggested adapting Iris-sensei's story,

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:20.780
and who decided where to put each picture.

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:23.660
That's true, you worked hard.

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:25.360
Well, she certainly did.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:29.120
It's fair that you were the leader this time, Ha-chan-san.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.390
See?

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.270
I look forward to playing.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.940
Thank you very much!

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:46.120
They seem to be having fun...

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:50.320
You don't have to look from this far away, you know?

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:54.590
No, thanks. I'm not used to it, unlike them.

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:58.700
Um, Hyakutake Teru-senpai, was it?

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:03.800
I was very interested to receive an invitation from a person so famous in our school.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:09.800
I'm more interested in how you always carry peeping items with you, though.

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:12.020
Please pay no mind to that.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:17.920
Out of respect for that liveliness, could you be more lax on them?

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:23.720
As I recall, Senpai, you became known for browsing through all sorts of clubs.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:29.210
As for me, I believe that it is essential to live with one's feet on the ground.

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:32.040
Bu-but if it's only a bit...

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.380
You're only young once,

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:38.500
so you should let that youth explode while you can.

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:40.260
I see...

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:43.380
Well, I'll be a bit more permissive.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:50.350
After all, she seems to have so much fun.

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:55.990
And so our summer Comiket ended.

00:13:57.470 --> 00:14:05.570
But for some reason, deep inside, I had a feeling of restlessness that I didn't understand.

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:08.700
I didn't know what it was until...

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:32.220
...a certain day some time after the fair,

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:37.490
when we went to the beach to celebrate the completion of our game.

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:41.080
You come out too, Murakami-san.

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.880
I-I can't do it. I'm going ho-

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.380
Ohh!

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:48.780
It suits you, President.

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:53.000
It was worth it to go store hopping for a swimsuit!

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:56.950
You wouldn't run away without wearing the combination your kouhai chose, right?

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:02.210
I'm not sociable or bold like Fujikawa-san!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:06.820
I'm just playing a character.

00:15:06.820 --> 00:15:09.720
It's surprisingly effective to start with appearances.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:14.400
President! Why don't you try talking like Fujikawa-senpai?

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:17.560
I-I suppose I'll tr-

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:18.850
I'll give it a shot.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.560
Tama-chan really is a seme after all.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.590
How long have you been there, Fuda-san?

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:31.570
The sun feels good, right, Murakami-san?

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:35.750
I did it, I hit it back!

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:40.120
President?!

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:42.320
Are you all right?!

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:47.640
I exhausted my life's supply of communication skills. I can't talk anymore.

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:48.420
No way!

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:56.600
A closing party?

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.700
Yes! You should come, too.

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.990
You worked on that game with us, and you're our friend.

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:05.880
Haa? I don't remember becoming friends with you.

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.900
We're rivals to the end!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:12.070
And I'm not a formal member of the SNS Club to begin with.

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.520
I'll pass on getting friendly with you.

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:16.460
Eh? Then you're not coming to the beach?

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:16.820
Uuh!

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:18.440
About that...

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:22.740
I see. It's a pity, but if you feel that way, it can't be helped.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.290
Ah, wait!

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:28.360
I didn't say I wasn't coming! I didn't!

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:32.310
Young Mistress, swimsuits are for swimming.

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:33.970
This is underwear!

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:43.920
I forgot to ask,

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:47.380
but if you came shopping with us yesterday, why are you wearing the school swimsuit?

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.610
I didn't have enough money.

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:53.700
Wait, Fuda Yumine isn't even a club member!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:57.280
Young Mistress, if you wish to join them, why don't you go already?

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:00.420
To be frank, you come off as a stalker.

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.330
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.200
I want to rest for a bit.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:06.650
My body feels somewhat hot.

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:08.420
Maybe it's a light heatstroke.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:12.900
How about we go to that rocky area? There's some shade, so it'll be cooler.

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:15.560
I'll go buy some drinks.

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:22.540
Ah!

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:23.680
What is it?

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.580
I thought of a new game!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.080
Eh, what kind of game?

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:29.520
Tell us, Onee-chan!

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:32.320
It combines the rules of tag and hopscotch.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.100
You have to run while hopping!

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:35.280
Sounds fun!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.460
I want to try it!

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:39.110
Okay, let's draw circles on the sand.

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:46.010
Onii-chan, wait!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.590
This feeling...

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:10.400
Honda-san, this way!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.000
Welcome back, Tama-chan. Thank you.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.740
Are you all right, President?

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.210
I rested a bit and I'm fine.

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:19.520
I'm sorry that I caused you concern.

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:22.290
We were worrying a bit since you took so long.

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:23.830
Sorry.

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:27.290
Are you all right, Honda-chan?

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:32.290
I'm...

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:35.010
I'm not all right!

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:38.960
I had forgotten something very important!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.320
The reason I originally joined this club.

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:43.120
It wasn't just to draw pictures,

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:46.390
it was to make a game that would make someone smile!

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:54.270
Well, if you just wanted to draw, there's the Illustration Club and the Art Club.

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:59.360
What do you want to do from now on, Honda-chan?

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:00.710
I-

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:05.540
I want to make a game based on my own concept next.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.860
Like Ha-chan did this time.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.170
O-of course, I can't do it alone.

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:14.210
But with your help...

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.380
That’s what I wanted to hear!

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:20.540
I want to find out what kind of games Honda-san makes.

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:23.900
Because you joined the SNS Club,

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:27.430
we were able to release two new games.

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:31.520
It's our turn to support you next.

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.360
President...

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.900
Then let's make a game with lots of handsome old men!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.220
I knew it.

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:45.720
By the way, the deadline for applying for winter Comiket is tomorrow. Will you be fine?

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:47.720
Ah, I forgot!

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:50.790
Winter Comiket? There's a winter Comiket next?

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.080
Yes, at the end of the year.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.380
There's also the culture festival in fall.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:59.080
But the next big event is winter Comiket.

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:01.480
Although we still don't know if we'll be accepted.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:04.840
I see! Then, as soon as the second term starts-

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.700
No, starting tomorrow-

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:10.680
No, starting today, let's do our best making our next game!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.890
Oh, you're fired up!

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.820
Okay, let's have a production meeting!

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:20.940
Deciding on the concept, setting up the schedule... There are plenty of things to do.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:23.800
It's going to become busy, Honda-san.

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:24.800
Yes!

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:27.320
I'll do my best!
